<font color="white">Kau mau mati dioperasi,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:11:52.128 --> 00:11:52.962
<font color="white">bukan mau hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:11:54.964 --> 00:11:56.132
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:11:56.215 --> 00:11:58.843
<font color="white">Sang-beom, apa yang dia katakan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:01.512 --> 00:12:04.640
<font color="white">"Bagaimana aku bisa membuatnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setuju dioperasi?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:07.059
<font color="white">Dia hanya bertahan untuk mati.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:09.478 --> 00:12:11.230
<font color="white">Bagaimana agar dia masuk rumah sakit?"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:14.108 --> 00:12:15.192
<font color="white">Aku mungkin gagal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:18.779 --> 00:12:20.573
<font color="white">Jika aku gagal, kau meninggal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:23.534 --> 00:12:24.827
<font color="white"><i>Kau mempertaruhkan nyawamu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:27.538
<font color="white"><i>pada operasi tanpa harapan.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:27.621 --> 00:12:29.540
<font color="white"><i>Hidup yang tak bisa kau akhiri sendiri.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:30.124 --> 00:12:31.208
<font color="white">Hidup yang kau jalani…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.295
<font color="white">Itu hidup orang lain.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:36.172 --> 00:12:38.132
<font color="white">Dan aku juga tahu kau tak sanggup hidup</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:38.799 --> 00:12:41.302
<font color="white">tanpa pernah melihat kakakmu lagi,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:42.303 --> 00:12:45.473
<font color="white">begitu kau tahu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">operasinya mungkin berhasil.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.228
<font color="white">Sang-beom, benarkah itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:54.857
<font color="white">Apa kau menyetujui operasinya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar kau bisa mati?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:56.484
<font color="white">Namun,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:57.067 --> 00:12:58.235
<font color="white">itu mustahil.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:12:58.319 --> 00:12:59.320
<font color="white">Mustahil, di tanganku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:00.446 --> 00:13:02.573
<font color="white">Aku akan berhasil dalam operasi ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:03.741 --> 00:13:07.036
<font color="white">Takkan kubiarkan kau lari</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari kesempatan untuk hidup.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.423
<font color="white">Kau harus menjalani operasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:22.218
<font color="white">Kenapa kau melakukannya? Kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:22.843 --> 00:13:23.969
<font color="white">Kau harus hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:24.053 --> 00:13:25.971
<font color="white">Kau harus berusaha dan hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:26.472 --> 00:13:28.098
<font color="white">Kau harus hidup!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:28.182 --> 00:13:30.309
<font color="white">Kau harus berusaha dan hidup!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:30.392 --> 00:13:31.644
<font color="white">Harus!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:49.411 --> 00:13:50.371
<font color="white">Dari mana kau tahu</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:51.372 --> 00:13:53.123
<font color="white">dia cuma bertahan untuk mati?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:53.916 --> 00:13:55.042
<font color="white">Aku tahu sorot mata itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:57.253 --> 00:13:58.254
<font color="white">Seolah dia berkata,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:59.213 --> 00:14:02.591
<font color="white">"Orang itu yang seharusnya selamat,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:03.592 --> 00:14:04.510
<font color="white">bukan aku."</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:05.844 --> 00:14:07.805
<font color="white">Orang yang tak ada pilihan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">selain bertahan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:14:09.181 --> 00:14:11.392
<font color="white">Orang yang sekadar bernapas, itu saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:13.143 --> 00:14:14.770
<font color="white">Orang yang menghukum diri sendiri</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.565
<font color="white">dengan bertahan hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.279
<font color="white">Sorot matanya hanya dimiliki orang begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:26.282 --> 00:14:28.158
<font color="white">Besok BAB-ku pasti lancar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:31.996 --> 00:14:32.830
<font color="white">Sudahlah, lupakan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:36.166
<font color="white">Dia tak mau dioperasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:37.001 --> 00:14:39.169
<font color="white">Dan Dokter Woo akan mengantarnya pulang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:40.504 --> 00:14:41.922
<font color="white">Kita sudah berusaha.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:43.591 --> 00:14:46.844
<font color="white">Jika ini terus berlanjut,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mentalnya pasti hancur.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:14:51.015 --> 00:14:54.393
<font color="white">Saat aku menahannya di atap gedung,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku sempat berpikir,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:14:55.352 --> 00:14:57.396
<font color="white">"Memangnya ke mana lagi dia bisa pergi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:59.273 --> 00:15:01.483
<font color="white">Meski operasinya berhasil,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:02.568 --> 00:15:05.863
<font color="white">bisakah dia menjalani hidupnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan baik?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:15:07.031 --> 00:15:08.240
<font color="white">Dan…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:08.324 --> 00:15:11.493
<font color="white">bagaimana jika dia pergi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ke atap gedung lagi?"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:15:15.331 --> 00:15:17.416
<font color="white">Maaf, aku mematahkan semangat kalian.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:18.167 --> 00:15:20.544
<font color="white">Peluangnya kecil, meski dia mau hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:21.545 --> 00:15:24.214
<font color="white">Jadi, bagaimana cara</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">menyelamatkan orang yang mau mati?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:15:28.552 --> 00:15:30.012
<font color="white">MINUMAN YOGURT</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:37.061 --> 00:15:39.271
<font color="white">Kau selalu sembelit. Semoga kau diare.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:39.355 --> 00:15:40.606
<font color="white">Dasar…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:40.689 --> 00:15:43.108
<font color="white">- Jangan katakan di depan…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kau pernah melakukannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:50.991
<font color="white">Menyelamatkan nyawa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:05.756 --> 00:16:06.715
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:08.884 --> 00:16:12.012
<font color="white">Jika operasinya lancar,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bisakah luka di hati Pak Oh ikut sembuh?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.723
<font color="white">Pasti bisa, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:15.975
<font color="white">Akan kau wujudkan, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:18.978
<font color="white">Aku tak tahu apa-apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:19.061 --> 00:16:23.649
<font color="white">Aku sama sekali tak tahu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">apa yang terbaik untuknya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:16:24.608 --> 00:16:25.609
<font color="white">Aku cuma…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:26.151 --> 00:16:29.738
<font color="white">Aku cuma ingin dia tidur nyenyak,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setidaknya begitu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:16:31.824 --> 00:16:33.826
<font color="white">Tapi kau tahu, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:33.909 --> 00:16:35.828
<font color="white">Ada caranya, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:34.154 --> 00:18:35.239
<font color="white">Pikirkanlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:36.532 --> 00:18:38.283
<font color="white">Pikirkanlah dan temukan caranya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:39.034 --> 00:18:41.995
<font color="white">Jika aku bisa mengoperasinya…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:43.038 --> 00:18:44.581
<font color="white">Jika aku bisa keluarkan pelurunya…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:45.916 --> 00:18:47.334
<font color="white">ada kesempatan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:49.837
<font color="white"><i>Dokter itu memberi tahu prajurit</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.422
<font color="white"><i>yang hendak menyeret Pak Oh pergi…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:52.506 --> 00:18:53.465
<font color="white">TRAUMA KEPALA AKIBAT LUKA TEMBAK</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:54.091 --> 00:18:55.634
<font color="white"><i>…bahwa ada peluru di kepalanya.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:57.136 --> 00:18:58.345
<font color="white">Suntikkan sedatif sekarang!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:58.428 --> 00:19:01.056
<font color="white"><i>Saat tidur atau terbangun,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>kau pasti mencari kakakmu.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:01.932 --> 00:19:05.185
<font color="white"><i>Kau akan terjaga di tengah malam,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>menangis tersedu-sedu,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:05.269 --> 00:19:08.021
<font color="white"><i>dan bilang, "Ini terlalu berat."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:08.105 --> 00:19:10.524
<font color="white"><i>Kau terus mengatakannya.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:17.406 --> 00:19:18.282
<font color="white">Lihatlah siapa ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:21.076 --> 00:19:24.246
<font color="white">Dokter Gye,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dokter bedah utama Pak Oh Sang-beom.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:24.329 --> 00:19:25.873
<font color="white">Mau absen pulang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:25.956 --> 00:19:29.710
<font color="white">Tak ada gunanya memantau pasien</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang mau dipindahkan, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:30.294 --> 00:19:31.128
<font color="white">Kau tak tahu, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:32.045 --> 00:19:36.091
<font color="white">Bagi orang yang sesumbar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahwa dia pasienmu,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:37.384
<font color="white">kau jelas tak tahu banyak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:38.594 --> 00:19:39.720
<font color="white">Tak akan ada operasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:39.803 --> 00:19:42.055
<font color="white">Kurasa sudah cukup.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:42.139 --> 00:19:43.765
<font color="white">Memangnya dokter pengganti tahu apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:47.144
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:47.227 --> 00:19:48.270
<font color="white">Kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:48.896 --> 00:19:50.147
<font color="white">Apa maumu sekarang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:51.982 --> 00:19:52.816
<font color="white">Siapa kau?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.026
<font color="white">Yang benar saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:01.241 --> 00:20:02.659
<font color="white">- Hei.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Hei!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:04.953
<font color="white">- Hei!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Keterlaluan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:05.037 --> 00:20:06.288
<font color="white">Ada apa dengannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:06.371 --> 00:20:08.832
<font color="white">- Dia tak mengenalku?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Akan kupulihkan kau, Pak Oh.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:11.001
<font color="white">- Dia tak mengenalku?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kumohon, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:11.084 --> 00:20:13.837
<font color="white">- Kita pernah bertemu. Hei!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Pak…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:13.921 --> 00:20:15.756
<font color="white">PUSAT MEDIS SEONAM UNIVERSITAS GUSEO</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:24.056 --> 00:20:25.098
<font color="white">Pergilah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:27.434 --> 00:20:30.062
<font color="white">Macbeth…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:30.979 --> 00:20:32.105
<font color="white">Macbeth…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:33.232 --> 00:20:35.692
<font color="white">Maafkan aku!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:36.818 --> 00:20:38.862
<font color="white">Apa-apaan? Ya ampun, dingin.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:38.946 --> 00:20:40.072
<font color="white">Klub teater, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:42.658
<font color="white">Ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:48.080
<font color="white">Masuklah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:52.376 --> 00:20:55.254
{\an8}<font color="white">DIREKTUR BU SEUNG-GWON</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:57.798 --> 00:20:58.674
<font color="white">Silakan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:47.889 --> 00:21:51.268
<font color="white">Dokter Gye, Dokter Jo, Dokter Park,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:51.351 --> 00:21:53.145
<font color="white">dan Dokter Kim.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:53.228 --> 00:21:56.648
<font color="white">Aku butuh penjelasan soal hal ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:56.732 --> 00:21:59.401
<font color="white">Bu Jang minta aku datang,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:59.484 --> 00:22:01.194
<font color="white">jadi kupenuhi, tapi…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:19.046 --> 00:22:20.589
<font color="white">Empat puluh enam tahun lalu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:21.465 --> 00:22:22.632
<font color="white">pada hari itu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:22.716 --> 00:22:24.968
<font color="white">pada malam dan momen itu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:25.969 --> 00:22:27.179
<font color="white">Akan kami peragakan</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:27.721 --> 00:22:30.390
<font color="white">kejadiannya pada hari itu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sesuai perkiraan kami.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:33.602 --> 00:22:36.772
<font color="white">Jangan khawatir. Duduk dan lihatlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:39.691 --> 00:22:41.693
<font color="white">Mereka memperagakan kejadian hari itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:44.362 --> 00:22:45.572
<font color="white">Kami menemukan ruangan</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:46.323 --> 00:22:49.993
<font color="white">yang paling mirip</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan tempat kejadiannya,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:50.577 --> 00:22:52.788
<font color="white">termasuk jendela dan ukurannya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:52.871 --> 00:22:54.748
<font color="white">tinggi langit-langit, dan lebar ruangan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:55.332 --> 00:22:58.001
<font color="white">Menurut saksi mata,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sekitar pukul 4 pagi pada hari itu,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:58.085 --> 00:23:01.546
<font color="white">sebuah helikopter menembakkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">senapan mesin ke jendela lantai delapan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:04.382
<font color="white">Gedung Gwangil.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:05.634 --> 00:23:08.053
<font color="white">Di ruangan itu,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ada Sang-beom yang berusia 12 tahun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:12.682 --> 00:23:14.351
<font color="white">Kakaknya, Seung-beom, usia 20 tahun.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:16.311 --> 00:23:17.437
<font color="white">Pemilik kedai makan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:18.396 --> 00:23:19.815
<font color="white">Paman kakaknya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:25.612
<font color="white">Paman kakaknya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:30.867 --> 00:23:31.827
<font color="white">Pamannya. Ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:35.497 --> 00:23:36.331
<font color="white">Dan…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:38.166 --> 00:23:40.085
<font color="white">teman sekelas Seung-beom di sekolah malam.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:41.461 --> 00:23:43.421
<font color="white">Setelah siaran aksi protes subuh itu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:43.505 --> 00:23:47.926
<font color="white">semuanya langsung masuk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan berlindung di gedung tersebut.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:48.635 --> 00:23:52.013
<font color="white">Tapi mereka tak tahu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebuah helikopter dikerahkan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:52.097 --> 00:23:54.266
<font color="white">atau senapan mesin akan menembaki mereka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:03.358
<font color="white">Mereka dengar suara helikopter.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:06.611
<font color="white">Mereka mendengarnya mendekat, lalu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:08.029 --> 00:24:10.866
<font color="white"><i>mereka melihatnya lewat jendela.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:11.741 --> 00:24:14.119
<font color="white">Mereka mencoba kabur,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:15.745 --> 00:24:17.998
<font color="white">tapi peluru menghujani mereka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:18.081 --> 00:24:19.332
<font color="white">Dan peluru itu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:37.392 --> 00:24:38.226
<font color="white">Seung-beom</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:38.977 --> 00:24:41.229
<font color="white">melindungi adiknya dengan tubuhnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:43.315 --> 00:24:44.900
<font color="white">Sang-beom!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:00.373 --> 00:25:03.293
<font color="white">Mustahil bagi Seung-beom</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk melindunginya sendirian.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:25:03.376 --> 00:25:04.920
<font color="white">Tapi bagaimana jika…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:06.004 --> 00:25:07.380
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika bukan cuma dia?</font><font color="white"></font>

