00:44:45.307 --> 00:44:47.101
<font color="white">Katanya pesta pascaoperasi itu wajib.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:47.184 --> 00:44:49.103
<font color="white">- Dia tanya kita mau ke mana.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Lupakan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:49.186 --> 00:44:50.354
<font color="white">Kau mau ke mana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:50.437 --> 00:44:52.231
<font color="white">- Pesta, 'kan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tunggu, Dokter Kim.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:52.314 --> 00:44:54.441
<font color="white">- Ya, 'kan? Ajak aku.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Bukan begitu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:54.525 --> 00:44:56.944
<font color="white">- Mau ke mana, Dokter Kim?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan ikuti aku!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:08.330 --> 00:45:10.416
<font color="white"><i>Hasilnya akan segera keluar.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:10.499 --> 00:45:12.584
<font color="white"><i>Jika kau salah,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>tak kuberi makan selama dua hari.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:13.085 --> 00:45:14.461
<font color="white"><i>Tak ada uang saku juga.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:23.345 --> 00:45:25.013
<font color="white">Kurasa malam ini dia tak bermimpi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:30.769 --> 00:45:32.855
<font color="white">PUSAT MEDIS SEONAM UNIVERSITAS GUSEO</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:36.275 --> 00:45:39.278
<font color="white">Aku masih tak percaya itu bukan peluru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:39.361 --> 00:45:41.822
<font color="white">Haruskah kita mengadakan konferensi pers?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:41.905 --> 00:45:45.033
<font color="white">Mereka bilang ini akan lebih tragis.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:45.117 --> 00:45:47.035
<font color="white">- Siapa yang bilang?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Orang-orang itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:47.703 --> 00:45:49.329
<font color="white">Bagaimana dengan orang di atas itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:50.038 --> 00:45:51.457
<font color="white">Dia masih di sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:01.508 --> 00:46:02.509
<font color="white">Ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:03.469 --> 00:46:06.805
<font color="white">Kubelikan kau ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">di toko terdekat kemarin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:46:18.275 --> 00:46:20.861
<font color="white">Syukurlah kau berhasil melewatinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:22.446 --> 00:46:24.406
<font color="white">Setelah konferensi pers,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:25.657 --> 00:46:28.035
<font color="white">kita pulang, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:00.567 --> 00:47:01.818
<font color="white">Kakakmu tak terlihat lagi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:15.415 --> 00:47:18.168
<font color="white">Syukurlah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kita bisa mengadakan konferensi pers.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:20.003 --> 00:47:22.714
<font color="white">Tak ada gunanya jika itu bukan peluru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:22.798 --> 00:47:24.883
<font color="white">Kami jadi heran</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kenapa harus mengadakannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:24.967 --> 00:47:29.638
<font color="white">Hasil rontgen pasti sudah menunjukkannya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat dia diperiksa pada saat itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:29.721 --> 00:47:30.639
<font color="white">Kenapa Dokter Gye tak kabari kita?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:30.722 --> 00:47:33.517
<font color="white">Karena dia mau melakukan operasi!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:33.600 --> 00:47:36.770
<font color="white">Gye Su-jeong atau siapa pun namanya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">memang gila operasi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:36.853 --> 00:47:39.982
<font color="white">Menurutku, tindakan Dokter Gye mirip</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:40.065 --> 00:47:43.485
<font color="white">tindakan dokter zaman dulu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:45.404 --> 00:47:46.530
<font color="white">Apa kau bilang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:47.406 --> 00:47:49.992
<font color="white">- Apa kau membelanya?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tentu saja tidak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:50.075 --> 00:47:51.910
<font color="white">Dia bersalah. Dia tetap berbohong.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:51.994 --> 00:47:55.664
<font color="white">Apa yang harus kusampaikan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">di konferensi pers nanti?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:55.747 --> 00:47:57.583
<font color="white">Aku bisa kehilangan muka!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:57.666 --> 00:47:58.750
<font color="white"><i>Jika mereka tahu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:58.834 --> 00:48:02.004
<font color="white">itu serpihan tulang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bukan peluru sejak awal,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:03.380 --> 00:48:05.716
<font color="white">akankah orang berisik itu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mendanai operasinya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:07.134 --> 00:48:10.804
<font color="white">Pak, aku sama sekali tak tertarik</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:10.887 --> 00:48:12.264
<font color="white">untuk mengatur atau menguasai dunia.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:13.265 --> 00:48:15.475
<font color="white">Aku bukan tipe orang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang hanya bilang "ya"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:16.268 --> 00:48:17.144
<font color="white">atau "tidak".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:18.145 --> 00:48:19.146
<font color="white">Aku hanyalah</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:20.355 --> 00:48:21.189
<font color="white">tipe orang…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:22.691 --> 00:48:24.526
<font color="white">yang bertanya, "Kenapa?"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:26.194 --> 00:48:27.237
<font color="white">"Kenapa?"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:30.198 --> 00:48:31.283
<font color="white">"Kenapa?"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:35.495 --> 00:48:36.330
<font color="white">Ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:38.081 --> 00:48:39.708
<font color="white">Apa? Apa kau bilang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:40.292 --> 00:48:42.628
<font color="white">Pak Oh Sang-beom menghilang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:45.422 --> 00:48:47.382
<font color="white">Ya ampun. Lihatlah kentang ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:48.008 --> 00:48:51.678
<font color="white">Saat masih di Korea Utara,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kentang membuatku bertahan hidup.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:52.804 --> 00:48:54.348
<font color="white">Telepon dari Dokter Woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:55.265 --> 00:48:56.391
<font color="white">Halo, Dokter Woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:57.142 --> 00:48:59.770
<font color="white">- Hentikanlah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Aku bermaksud meneleponmu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:01.146 --> 00:49:02.356
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:02.439 --> 00:49:03.732
<font color="white">Maksudku,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:03.815 --> 00:49:06.109
<font color="white">aku cuma pergi ke toilet sebentar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:06.193 --> 00:49:07.653
<font color="white">- Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dia tidak di sini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:08.236 --> 00:49:09.946
<font color="white">Dia tak ada di kamarnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:12.449 --> 00:49:15.243
<font color="white">TERIMA KASIH ATAS SEMUANYA</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">MAAFKAN AKU</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:38.225 --> 00:49:39.267
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:40.435 --> 00:49:42.646
<font color="white">Dia tidak ada di atap gedung, syukurlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:43.230 --> 00:49:44.231
<font color="white">Sangat bersyukur.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:44.314 --> 00:49:46.274
<font color="white">Kuperiksa CCTV-nya, tapi dia tak terlihat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:46.817 --> 00:49:48.318
<font color="white">Kurasa dia masih di rumah sakit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:50.112 --> 00:49:51.571
<font color="white">HASIL OPERASI KORBAN PEMBERONTAKAN GWANGJU</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:51.655 --> 00:49:55.367
<font color="white">Tragedi di Gwangju</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">adalah tragedi kita semua.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:55.450 --> 00:49:58.912
<font color="white">Rasa sakit diderita di Gwangju</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">adalah rasa sakit kita bersama.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:58.995 --> 00:50:02.874
<font color="white">Serpihan tulang yang diangkat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dalam operasi itu</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:03.959 --> 00:50:07.254
<font color="white">mengungkap kisah dari tragedi itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:08.046 --> 00:50:09.172
<font color="white">Jalur pelurunya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:09.756 --> 00:50:12.384
<font color="white">Serpihan kepedihan yang hancur</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tertanam jauh di dalamnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:12.884 --> 00:50:13.969
<font color="white">Sanggupkah kita</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:14.052 --> 00:50:16.763
<font color="white">- berpaling dari itu?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dia pintar bersilat lidah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:17.347 --> 00:50:19.975
<font color="white">Dia menguasai keadaan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:20.058 --> 00:50:21.518
<font color="white">Keadaannya jadi lebih baik.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:21.601 --> 00:50:24.521
<font color="white">Jika Pak Oh di sini,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dia tak akan bisa berpidato begitu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:25.021 --> 00:50:26.690
<font color="white">Wali kotanya juga takkan disorot.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:26.773 --> 00:50:28.692
<font color="white">Kita tak boleh membiarkan tragedi begini…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:28.775 --> 00:50:30.444
<font color="white">Pak, soal pernyataan yang kita susun tadi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:31.737 --> 00:50:32.988
<font color="white">Semoga kau berpegang teguh padanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:43.081 --> 00:50:44.124
<font color="white">Masuklah!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:44.207 --> 00:50:46.835
<font color="white">Dia bukan warga sini,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi pasti tak bisa pergi jauh.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:46.918 --> 00:50:48.712
<font color="white">- Masuk.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Aku…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:48.795 --> 00:50:50.839
<font color="white">Aku naik mobilku saja. Lebih aman dari…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:50.922 --> 00:50:52.382
<font color="white">- Masuk saja.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tapi…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:52.466 --> 00:50:54.718
<font color="white">- Cepatlah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tunggu, Bu Jang, aku…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:56.970 --> 00:50:58.180
<font color="white">- Sabuk pengaman!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Baik.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:01.975 --> 00:51:05.061
<font color="white">Berikutnya, Direktur Bu Seung-gwon</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:05.145 --> 00:51:07.147
<font color="white">akan menerima pertanyaan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:08.440 --> 00:51:10.233
<font color="white">Jadi, mereka mencari nama,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:10.317 --> 00:51:12.194
<font color="white">dan biarkan Direktur menanggung kesalahan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:12.277 --> 00:51:13.320
<font color="white">Diamlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:13.403 --> 00:51:16.198
<font color="white">Kenapa tak lakukan sendiri saja</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan tak melibatkan Direktur?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:16.281 --> 00:51:19.201
<font color="white">Dia hanya menyetujuinya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">demi masa depan rumah sakit ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:19.284 --> 00:51:22.871
<font color="white">Aku ingin berterima kasih kepada reporter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang telah hadir hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:23.413 --> 00:51:26.875
<font color="white">Aku Direktur Bu Seung-gwon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari Pusat Medis Universitas Guseo.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:26.958 --> 00:51:28.335
<font color="white">Silakan bertanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:30.253 --> 00:51:32.088
<font color="white">Kenapa Pak Oh Sang-beom tak hadir?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:32.172 --> 00:51:35.634
<font color="white">Dia belum pulih</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan masih harus beristirahat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:38.845 --> 00:51:42.098
<font color="white">Dari hasil pemeriksaan,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bisa diketahui itu bukan peluru,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:42.182 --> 00:51:43.558
<font color="white">kenapa operasi dilakukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:44.142 --> 00:51:48.355
<font color="white">Konon rencana awalnya,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dia mau dipindahkan karena Pak Ji Du-seok.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:19.052 --> 00:52:20.637
<font color="white">MI OBOK</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:20.720 --> 00:52:21.555
<font color="white"><i>Tolong jawab kami.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:21.638 --> 00:52:23.014
<font color="white">Kenapa dia dioperasi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:23.723 --> 00:52:26.351
<font color="white">Hasil rontgen memang menunjukkan</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:26.935 --> 00:52:31.064
<font color="white">itu serpihan tulang, bukan peluru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:31.606 --> 00:52:35.819
<font color="white">Akan tetapi,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kita tidak bisa serta-merta mengabaikan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:35.902 --> 00:52:39.322
<font color="white">masalah yang mengganggu hidup si pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:39.906 --> 00:52:43.869
<font color="white">Jujur, itu operasi yang sangat berisiko.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:44.452 --> 00:52:48.832
<font color="white">Tapi dokter hebat di rumah sakit kami,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:48.915 --> 00:52:51.543
<font color="white">beserta para donatur terhormat,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Wali Kota Im Ho-seok,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:52.085 --> 00:52:55.422
<font color="white">Ketua Kim Chang-su dari Ikatan Dokter,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:55.505 --> 00:52:59.885
<font color="white">dan Ketua Gu Bon-pyeong</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari Yayasan Guseo,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:00.719 --> 00:53:01.970
<font color="white">punya tekad yang kuat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:03.847 --> 00:53:05.974
<font color="white">Kau benar-benar tak mau menerimanya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:06.057 --> 00:53:07.767
<font color="white">Singkirkan sebelum aku berubah pikiran.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:08.268 --> 00:53:11.229
<font color="white">Jangan gunakan ketiadaan peluru</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai alasan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:11.313 --> 00:53:14.482
<font color="white">untuk membatalkan pendanaan operasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan membebani Pak Oh</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:15.734 --> 00:53:16.776
<font color="white">dengan tagihan besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:19.946 --> 00:53:20.947
<font color="white">Boleh tanya kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:23.199 --> 00:53:25.619
<font color="white">Ada istilah "neujagu" dalam dialek Jeolla.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:26.536 --> 00:53:28.872
<font color="white">Aku tak mau orang bilang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku tak punya </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>neujagu</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:29.581 --> 00:53:30.665
<font color="white">"Neujagu"?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:31.291 --> 00:53:32.334
<font color="white">"Etika dasar"?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:34.002 --> 00:53:34.961
<font color="white">Sampai jumpa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:35.921 --> 00:53:37.422
<font color="white">Sialan!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:37.505 --> 00:53:40.091
<font color="white">Aku benar-benar mau beli mobil baru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:43.303 --> 00:53:44.429
<font color="white">Di mana wadahnya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:45.847 --> 00:53:46.973
<font color="white">Ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:47.057 --> 00:53:50.226
<font color="white">- Bukankah itu serpihan tulang Pak Oh…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Bukan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:50.310 --> 00:53:51.227
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:51.770 --> 00:53:53.438
<font color="white">Ini bukan milik Pak Oh.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:56.650 --> 00:53:58.944
<font color="white">- Hei, itu Pak Oh!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Di mana?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:00.487 --> 00:54:01.988
<font color="white">Dia masuk ke lorong belakang itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:02.948 --> 00:54:06.618
<font color="white"><i>Pak Oh Sang-beom</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>masih berusia 12 tahun pada saat itu.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:07.202 --> 00:54:10.246
<font color="white"><i>Saat pasukan darurat militer</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>mencoba menangkapnya lagi,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:10.330 --> 00:54:12.123
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>kurasa dokter utamanya</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:12.707 --> 00:54:15.919
<font color="white">berbohong demi kebaikannya</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:16.002 --> 00:54:17.170
<font color="white">pada saat itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:18.046 --> 00:54:21.800
<font color="white">Dan saat catatan medisnya terbakar,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:21.883 --> 00:54:23.385
<font color="white">kebohongan itu menjadi fakta.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:25.387 --> 00:54:29.224
<font color="white">Kami merawat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Pak Oh Sang-beom dan Pak Ji Du-seok</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:29.307 --> 00:54:31.726
<font color="white">karena mereka adalah pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:32.394 --> 00:54:35.855
<font color="white">Kami tak pernah berniat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">memindahkan salah satu dari mereka.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:36.439 --> 00:54:38.274
